#
# The scanner of the HISS rules in .config/semgrep/hiss.yml, in an environment
# of its own: its dependency tree is large and pins versions the gate's tools
# do not need, so it stays out of dev.in. semgrep.txt is its lock, compiled
# the same way as dev.txt by `make lock`.
semgrep==1.180.0
